+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: Proposition 6.2 supplies an exact finite-field construction, "
+        "and an O(h^2 q^2) anchor-pair/parameter scan is polynomial in q; at "
+        "shipping q=241, seed 271828, it used 87,163 hypotheses and 430,947 "
