The revised family now has an exact shipping density, not just a zero-hit estimate: 12 independently sampled B anchors remove alternative \(\omega\)-representations, leaving one valid certificate among 1,799,154 structure-aware candidates at the shipping seed. The implemented compact recovery solves the tested shipping instances in at most 262 counted field operations, while the full reference scan performs millions of exact point transformations.
