 Lemma \ref{lem:generalcase}
 shows that a ${\rm GBTD}_1(3,m)$ exists for all odd $m\not=3,5$. Theorem \ref{thm:main} (vi) now follows.


 
 
 \subsection{Existence of GBTP$_1(\{2,3^*\};2m+1,m\times(2m-3))$}

