Implemented a verified Track B generator based on Proposition 6.2 of the [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/1304.0278).

Local results:

- Exact shipping density: `1 / 1,799,154 = 5.558×10⁻⁷`
- Four attacks: `0/8` successes each
- Reference scan: 480,410 hypotheses, 1,441,572 transformations
- Compact route: at most 262 exact operations
- Answer size: 47 characters, 5 atoms
- All nine local gates pass
- Additional exhaustive checks covered 30 small admissible starters and 10 carried relabellings

Deliverables:

- [gen_1304_0278.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1304.0278/gen_1304_0278.py)
